  "canvas-theme-editor.helpModalBody1": {
    "message": "Pick a starter template, edit it like you would in the Canvas Rich Content Editor, then click <strong>Copy HTML</strong> and paste the result into a Canvas page (switch to the HTML editor view first). Canvas sanitizes pasted HTML server-side — this preview doesn't attempt to replicate that, so always verify the pasted result in Canvas.",
